```
id: SPL-010
name: Privileged directory role assigned
description: Member added to a directory role in the identity provider audit log.
platform: Splunk
mitre_tactic: Persistence
mitre_technique: T1098.003 Account Manipulation: Additional Cloud Roles
severity: High
data_source: index=azure (audit logs)
false_positives: Approved joiner, mover or break-glass activity.
tuning: Correlate with change tickets; exclude the governance automation identity.
test_method: Assign a privileged role to a lab user.
owner: <OWNER>
status: Draft
last_review: 2026-11-19
```
index=azure sourcetype="mscs:azure:eventhub" category=AuditLogs operationName IN ("Add member to role","Add eligible member to role") earliest=-1h
| eval actor=coalesce('properties.initiatedBy.user.userPrincipalName','properties.initiatedBy.app.displayName')
| eval target='properties.targetResources{}.userPrincipalName'
| table _time operationName actor target 'properties.targetResources{}.displayName' result
| sort - _time
